            }
          ],
          "text": "According to Respondents, expert agencies charged with implementing the Clean Water Act have concluded that the discharge of fill material should be permitted by the Army Corps of Engineers under CWA \u00a7404 and is not subject to EPA effluent guidelines under \u00a7402."
        },
        {
          "attribution": "Mr. Waldo (Respondents)",
          "citations": [
